                  <tr><td style="padding:10px 12px 0 12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#8fd8ee;"><span style="color:#de6a09;">&#x2708;&#xFE0E;</span> МОСКВА:</td></tr>
                  <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 12px 12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#d5e9ef;line-height:1.4;">проспект Андропова, 11, корпус 2, Южный Event-Port.</td></tr>
